    "detailed_description": "&quot;Be a hero to save the Tiny Kingdom from crisis!&quot;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience a variety of exciting VR games!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe mission of the game is to strategically use stones and minimons, which are basic weapons, to defeat the opponent.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features<br />\r\n     - Throw stones to reduce the opponent's HP.<br />\r\n     - Fight with various minimons.<br />\r\n     - They will want you to complete the mission within the time limit.<br />\r\n     - You can enjoy a total of 4 stages.<br />\r\n     - This is a multiplayer game.<br />\r\n     - You can only play in VR.<br />\r\n     - A minimum space of 2 square meters is required.<br />\r\n     - Only playable on Oculus.",
